https://huggingface.co/baidu/ERNIE-Image-Turbo
Original model revision: bc68c81e2a1730a394d5fc9fae70713dee940140
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Format conversion and package preparation: mingshi2333 / akashimio, 2026.
Runtime and conversion tools:
https://github.com/mingshi2333/ernie-image-ncnn-vulkan

The original model has been converted to ncnn computation graphs and weight
streams, with project-specific tokenizer/configuration files and shared-object
packaging. These are converted deployment artifacts, not a newly trained model.
All converted artifacts under turbo/ and pe/ are modified representations of
the original model. Their original manifests and provenance have been retained.
No new weight conversion or quantization was performed for this upload.

The pinned upstream model repository contains LICENSE and no NOTICE file.
